{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GR4TShxE4WhdHAS7vaYKQK","type":"tool_result","content":"65-  - `actions/` — `Button`, `IconButton`\n66-  - `feedback/` — `Badge`, `InfoBanner`, `Spinner`\n67-  - `forms/` — `Input`, `Select`, `Checkbox`, `Radio` / `RadioGroup`, `SearchField`\n68-  - `icons/` — `Eye`, `EyeOff`\n69:  - `navigation/` — `Tabs`, `Toggle`, `NavItem`\n70-  - `surfaces/` — `AuthLayout`, `Card`, `Modal`\n71-  - `data/` — `Table`\n72-  - `typography/` — `SectionLabel`\n73-- `templates/` — copy-paste-ready pages:\n74-  - `meridian-app/MeridianApp.dc.html` — the full product build (Timesheets, Members, Reports, Time-off, Org).\n75-  - `redesign-board/RedesignBoard.dc.html` — the Before/After audit board.\n76-- `SKILL.md` — cross-compatible Agent Skills manifest.\n77-- `thumbnail.html` — project tile.\n78-\n79-## The signed-out shell\n80-\n81-The Meridian source build covers the authenticated product only — it has no login, signup, or password screen. `AuthLayout` fills that hole: warm paper field, the text wordmark, one centred card at 480px max-width, nothing else. Signup, login, forgot-password, and reset-password all sit in it. There is no theme toggle on those routes; the signed-out surface follows the system preference.\n=== component file ===\nnavigation.card.html\nNavItem.d.ts\nNavItem.jsx\nNavItem.prompt.md\nTabs.d.ts\nTabs.jsx\nTabs.prompt.md\nToggle.d.ts\nToggle.jsx\nToggle.prompt.md\nimport React from 'react';\n\nexport function Tabs({ items = [], value, onChange, style }) {\n  return (\n    <div style={{\n      display: 'flex', gap: 26,\n      borderBottom: '1.5px solid var(--divider)', ...style,\n    }}>\n      {items.map((it) => {\n        const v = typeof it === 'string' ? it : it.value;\n        const l = typeof it === 'string' ? it : it.label;\n        const disabled = typeof it === 'string' ? false : !!it.disabled;\n        const testId = typeof it === 'string' ? undefined : it.testId;\n        const active = v === value;\n        const label = (\n          <span style={{\n            display: 'block',\n            fontFamily: 'var(--font-display)', fontWeight: active ? 600 : 500,\n            fontSize: 'var(--fs-14)', letterSpacing: '.3px',\n            color: disabled ? 'var(--text-faint)' : (active ? 'var(--text)' : 'var(--text-muted)'),\n            transition: 'color .15s',\n          }}>{l}</span>\n        );\n        const underline = (\n          <div style={{\n            marginTop: 12, marginBottom: -1.5,\n            height: 3, borderRadius: 3,\n            background: active ? 'var(--accent)' : 'transparent',\n          }} />\n        );\n        // Disabled placeholder tabs (Projects/Roles/Payments today, Vacation until\n        // spec 07) render as a non-interactive span — greyed label, no underline,\n        // no click — rather than an anchor, so they can never fire `onChange`.\n        if (disabled) {\n          return (\n            <span key={v} data-testid={testId} aria-disabled=\"true\"\n              style={{ paddingBottom: 12, cursor: 'not-allowed' }}>\n              {label}{underline}\n            </span>\n          );\n        }\n        return (\n          <a key={v} href=\"#\" data-testid={testId}\n            onClick={(e) => { e.preventDefault(); onChange && onChange(v); }}\n            style={{ textDecoration: 'none', cursor: 'pointer', paddingBottom: 12 }}>\n            {label}{underline}\n          </a>\n        );\n      })}\n    </div>\n  );\n}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d8104197-4eeb-4137-8f54-59290205c2a9","uuid":"3189fe05-281e-4a15-a014-f11dde1004c9","timestamp":"2026-09-03T05:18:27.376Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"65-  - `actions/` — `Button`, `IconButton`\n66-  - `feedback/` — `Badge`, `InfoBanner`, `Spinner`\n67-  - `forms/` — `Input`, `Select`, `Checkbox`, `Radio` / `RadioGroup`, `SearchField`\n68-  - `icons/` — `Eye`, `EyeOff`\n69:  - `navigation/` — `Tabs`, `Toggle`, `NavItem`\n70-  - `